Meta.documentation:Number.negate
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Flips the sign of each Number passing through.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Streaming operator: each input Number is emitted negated.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_$all — each Number to negate
Meta.documentation:@port out_Number — the negated result
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:Number:5>>Number.negate:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:-5
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see Number.subtract Number.reciprocate
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable
Meta.documentation:

